sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student browser
    participant CF as CloudFront + WAF
    participant S3F as S3 frontend
    participant CG as Cognito
    participant ALB as ALB
    participant API as API task (Fargate)
    participant DB as RDS PostgreSQL (Multi-AZ)
    participant Q as SQS marking queue
    participant M as marking-fn (Lambda)

    S->>CF: GET / (HTTPS)
    CF->>S3F: fetch page (cached at the edge)
    S-->>CG: sign in (email + password)
    CG-->>S: ID token (JWT, contains the group "student")
    S->>CF: POST /api/exams/12/start + Bearer token
    CF->>ALB: forward (adds secret header, WAF checked it)
    ALB->>API: pick a healthy task in either AZ
    API->>API: verify JWT signature, check role = student
    API->>DB: check exam window, create attempt, fixed deadline
    DB-->>API: attempt id + questions
    API-->>S: questions (no correct answers) + server deadline
    loop every 30 seconds
        S->>API: PUT /api/attempts/57/answers (changed answers only)
        API->>DB: upsert answers (idempotent)
        API-->>S: saved at hh:mm:ss
    end
    S->>API: POST /api/attempts/57/submit
    API->>DB: status = submitted
    API->>Q: send {attemptId: 57}
    API-->>S: 202 Accepted
    Q->>M: deliver message
    M->>DB: score the MCQ answers, status = marked
